Option 1 (Recommended): Use Supabase Realtime + Auth hooks instead of polling:
- Set last_seen_at via an Auth hook that fires on every JWT refresh (automatic)
- Or use `auth.onAuthStateChanged()` to sync presence on auth state changes
- No polling interval needed

Option 2: Use database trigger on INSERT into any user-action table:
```sql
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION update_user_presence()
RETURNS TRIGGER AS $$
BEGIN
    UPDATE profiles
    SET last_seen_at = now()
    WHERE id = auth.uid();
    RETURN NEW;
END;
$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;

-- Trigger on forum_posts, forum_comments, chat_messages, etc.
CREATE TRIGGER forum_posts_update_presence
AFTER INSERT ON forum_posts
FOR EACH ROW
EXECUTE FUNCTION update_user_presence();
